LofiMart (Commerce OS) — Complete Codebase Reverse-Engineering Report
Method: Every claim below was verified against actual source files. Direct tools used: full read of prisma/schema.prisma (1498 lines), package.json, server.ts (15,599 lines, 264 route registrations), src/server/routes/*.ts (90 routes), 98 App Router route.ts files, 122 page.tsx files, 10 loading.tsx, all contexts/hooks/workers/modules, docs/ and CI/Docker. All findings cite file:line.
1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
1.1 What type of application
LofiMart — a Bangladesh-focused (BDT) multi-vendor e-commerce marketplace ("Commerce OS"). Dual-stack: Next.js 15 App Router (frontend + API routes) fronted by a custom Express.js HTTP server that serves Next and hosts 264 Express API routes. Supports 4 roles (customer, seller, reseller, admin), multi-courier (Pathao/RedX/Steadfast/Paperfly), multiple payment gateways (bKash/Stripe/SSLCommerz/COD/wallet), a Telegram seller bot, BullMQ background workers, gamification/referrals, community, PWA, AI features, AR/3D immersive features, POS, and double-entry accounting.
1.2 Project maturity
Late-stage prototype / pre-production. Declared "production-ready" in docs, but verified blockers: Docker image is non-functional (missing runtime node_modules, Dockerfile:32-33; wrong healthcheck URL), CI lint job is red (144 ESLint errors), no prisma migrations exist (prisma/migrations/ absent), scripts/ folder missing (3 npm scripts broken), no CD pipeline, no E2E tests, 0 per-page SEO metadata.
