6. CUSTOMER FLOW
Landing (/, 4 sections from /api/shop-page) → browse (/shop filters/sort) → search (/search) → categories → product page (/product/[slug], 3D/AR/AI embedded) → add cart (Redis) → checkout (address, coupon, COD/bKash/wallet) → POST /api/orders → order confirmation (/order-success) → order splits into per-seller shipments → seller accepts → courier booked → tracking via /track + webhook status → delivered → review → return request → admin approves → wallet credit.
7. SELLER FLOW
Register (role=seller) → submit verification (VerificationSubmission NID/docs) → admin reviews (/api/admin/verification-queue) → sellerStatus=approved → onboarding checklist (/api/seller/onboarding-status) → products (form/bulk CSV) → inventory (multi-warehouse) → orders (/api/seller/orders, accept/ship) → courier booking (POST /api/seller/courier/bookings) → earnings (/api/seller/earnings) → payout request (POST /api/users/payout-request) → admin reviews payout → paid.
8. RESELLER FLOW
Register role=reseller → onboarding → catalog select → set markup (POST /api/reseller/markup) → referral code (/api/reseller/referral-link) → custom storefront /r/[code] → customer orders via refCode → reseller price applied → commission row created (ResellerCommission, status pending) → payout request → admin review.
9. ADMIN FLOW
Dashboard (4 parallel API calls) → users (block/unblock/role/risk-flags) → sellers (approve via status) → verification queue (KYC review) → products/reviews moderation → orders (status override) → returns review → payments/payouts → accounting (double-entry ledger, /api/admin/accounting) → POS (POST /api/admin/pos/checkout) → logistics diagnostics + Pathao token mgmt → coupons/flash-sale/banners/blog/categories/community/gamification → settings → performance (web-vitals).
10. ORDER MANAGEMENT
Lifecycle: processing → accepted → pickup_requested → picked_up → out_for_delivery → delivered (per shipment) + cancelled, return_requested, return_approved, delivery_failed. Order-level aggregate status derived from shipments. Inventory deduction: atomic stock.decrement in the same transaction (server.ts:7995-8007) — but InventoryItem.quantity/reserved are NOT decremented on order (only Product.stock), a real data-integrity gap. Payment confirmation only marks order paid (webhook). Cancel/edit blocked once courier flow starts (server.ts:1806). Returns → AccountActionRequest.
11. PAYMENT SYSTEM
- COD: paymentStatus unpaid, courier collects (docs/Payment-Flow.md:66 — "only COD available" per checkout guard server.ts:7744 isCheckoutPaymentMethodEnabled)
- bKash: tokenized checkout (initiate→execute→verify→callback), token cached in Redis, webhook
- Stripe: create-intent + verified webhook (signature), stripeGateway.ts
- SSLCommerz: sslcommerzGateway.ts gateway class (no live routes found)
- Wallet: deduct balance
- Idempotency: PaymentTransaction.idempotencyKey unique
- Refund: only DB-level Refund record + wallet credit; no gateway refund calls wired
- Settlement/payout: manual admin review, no auto-settlement
12. COMMISSION SYSTEM — MISSING (documented-only)
No platform-commission calculation anywhere in code. /api/seller/earnings = gross price×qty sums (seller.ts:1330-1374). No tax/VAT field except Invoice.tax (default 0). Shipping fee: hardcoded CHECKOUT_PLATFORM_FEE=5 and client-supplied deliveryFee (added into order total in routes/orders.ts — a client-trust price manipulation vector). Reseller: ResellerCommission.amount recorded but no settlement engine.
13. SELLER PAYOUT
PayoutMethod (encrypted account fields, last4), PayoutTransaction (pending→processed), POST /api/users/payout-request → admin review /api/admin/payout-transactions/:id/review. No wallet-hold/pending/available balance state machine. "Earnings" ≠ "payable" (no commission/fee deduction).
14. COURIER SYSTEM
Provider registry → adapters (Pathao API w/ auto store sync, RedX API, Steadfast API, Manual). Booking flow at seller.ts:620-867. Webhook POST /api/logistics/webhooks/:provider (logistics.ts:729) verifies bearer/token/header token. Status normalization via logisticsHelpers.ts (tested). No shipping labels (packing slip/invoice only), no failed-delivery return-to-seller workflow beyond status strings, no delivery-fee reconciliation.
15. RETURN & REFUND
Request → AccountActionRequest(type='return_request') → admin review (/api/admin/return-requests/:id/review) → approve → status update, stock restore claimed in docs but not implemented for refunds → wallet credit. No gateway refunds, no replacement flow.
